%% Reprise IDE - issue lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LISTED
    LISTED --> REPLICATING: user acknowledges
    REPLICATING --> CONFIRMED
    REPLICATING --> FLAKY
    REPLICATING --> DUPLICATE
    REPLICATING --> NEEDS_INFO
    REPLICATING --> BLOCKED_ENV
    REPLICATING --> STOPPED: user declines provided test
    REPLICATING --> ERROR
    NEEDS_INFO --> REPLICATING: acknowledge again
    BLOCKED_ENV --> REPLICATING: acknowledge again
    STOPPED --> REPLICATING: acknowledge again
    ERROR --> REPLICATING: acknowledge again
    CONFIRMED --> FIXING: propose fix
    FLAKY --> FIXING: propose fix
    FIXING --> FIX_ABANDONED: no usable change
    FIXING --> VERIFYING: verify
    CONFIRMED --> VERIFYING: verify a human PR
    FLAKY --> VERIFYING: verify a human PR
    FIX_ABANDONED --> FIXING: propose fix again
    VERIFYING --> FIX_VERIFIED
    VERIFYING --> FIX_INCOMPLETE
    VERIFYING --> REGRESSION_DETECTED
    FIX_INCOMPLETE --> FIXING
    REGRESSION_DETECTED --> FIXING
    FIX_INCOMPLETE --> VERIFYING: new commits
    REGRESSION_DETECTED --> VERIFYING: new commits
    FIX_VERIFIED --> RESOLVED: PR merged
    DUPLICATE --> [*]
    RESOLVED --> [*]
